{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13218240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823001:":{"text":"感じる……","source_cn":"我感觉到了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD957B9B18E3CA5F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823002:":{"text":"これは……血の共鳴。","source_cn":"血脉的共鸣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3D93F64DA5D853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321824001:1":{"text":"母親の遺骨とかすかな共鳴を感じる……かなり薄れてはいるが、彼女はヴァレサ家の血筋の者だ。","source_cn":"女孩母亲的遗骸与我有了隐约的共鸣，也就是说……虽然稀薄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF3AFF5CCCD5E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321824002:1":{"text":"つまり、カタストロフの眷族は遺骨からそれを感じ取り、オルカの父親を襲ったのか？彼が……妻の遺骨を持っていたから……？","source_cn":"也就是说……那些恶魔眷属感受到了这位女士遗骨中的血脉能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F8E4EA33F9EE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321824003:1":{"text":"現状から判断するなら、そういうことだ。","source_cn":"从现有的条件来看，的确如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F11D021776FD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321824004:1":{"text":"もしそれが本当なら……オルカさんは、母親からヴァレサ家の血を継いでいるということですよね。","source_cn":"如果这一切都成立，那么奥尔嘉……她当然也从她的母亲那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29CA798BACF7488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321824005:1":{"text":"なら、この子はヴァレサ家の者……ヴァレサ家の血は、途絶えていなかった……？","source_cn":"所以这个孩子就是瓦勒沙家族之人，瓦勒沙家族……竟然还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF042F5310B11B26A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321824006:1":{"text":"僕の魔法が間違えるはずはない。だが、まさか……一族の血を引く者がまだいたとは……","source_cn":"我的魔法……我的魔法应该是不会出错的，所以这一切都是真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9236FC137A1D0699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321824007:1":{"text":"フェルガルド殿、オルカの父親は、手記や書類の類いを所持していなかっただろうか？それを見れば、何か分かるかもしれない。","source_cn":"法拉莫尔，我想看看奥尔嘉父亲携带的笔记或者文件，或许能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF833AC5FD81C53E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321824008:1":{"text":"オルカがいいというのなら……","source_cn":"这需要奥尔嘉的同意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD541CF8DE4165D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu